229p|v|To fit with, or as with, a tag or tags. ; To join; to fasten; to attach. ; To follow closely after; esp., to follow and touch in the game of tag. See Tag, a play. ; To follow closely, as it were an appendage; -- often with after; as, to tag after a person. ; A child's play in which one runs after and touches another, and then runs away to avoid being touched.	o:29zr,39,1;qle,23,1;nkm,11,2;jpm,9,2~jpm,9,2;nkm,11,2;qle,23,1;29zr,39,1	s:zgx,40,4;gkr,19,5;d6h,18,4;8r7,14,2;2b16,11,1;1o06,9,3;14t0,5,4;45o,0,2~gkr,19,5;d6h,18,4;14t0,5,4;zgx,40,4;1o06,9,3;8r7,14,2;45o,0,2;2b16,11,1	d:18yb,11,3~18yb,11,3
