22l7|n|Labor or study imposed by another, often in a definite quantity or amount. ; Business; employment; undertaking; labor. ; To impose a task upon; to assign a definite amount of business, labor, or duty to. ; To oppress with severe or excessive burdens; to tax. ; To charge; to tax; as with a fault.	a:25pk,74,9;1102,56,6;1y56,36,11;1wfn,35,5;eep,25,3;sjm,8,4~1y56,36,11;25pk,74,9;1102,56,6;1wfn,35,5;sjm,8,4;eep,25,3	n:1y56,1,1~1y56,1,1
